1
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:12,000
The garden gate stays open
until the evening.

2
00:00:12,708 --> 00:00:14,500
<i>Water the tomatoes first.</i>

3
00:00:14,800 --> 00:00:16,950
Then the beans by the wall.

4
00:00:17,250 --> 00:00:19,000
The hose is in the shed.

5
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:02,333
Has anyone seen the blue bucket?

6
00:01:02,708 --> 00:01:05,000
It was by the pond this morning.

7
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:09,750
I will look there after lunch.

8
00:01:10,100 --> 00:01:10,700
Thanks.

9
00:01:19,600 --> 00:01:20,300
Wait.

10
00:01:20,050 --> 00:01:22,000
- Over here!
- Coming.

11
00:01:30,500 --> 00:01:31,208
Rain at four.

